      - 🇸🇬 SG-Auto
      - 🇭🇰 HK-Auto
      - 🇹🇼 TW-Auto
      - 🇯🇵 JP-Auto
      - 🇨🇦 CA-Auto
      - 🇬🇧 UK-Auto
      - PROXY-Gate
      - DIRECT

